      "id": 230278,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-04-17T12:41:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Tackle is ludicrous. Something gets anywhere near you, you get to attack it, and it does loads of damage. Amazing for an attack named after the most basic Pokemon move. XD</p>\n<p>It's kinda like Bunker's Overwatch. He seems to do more damage on his turn in Operations Mode, but I find setting him in Turret Mode in the middle of the field and just letting him machine gun everything in sight puts out more damage overall.</p>",
