      "created_at": "2020-04-22T13:04:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Okay, it's not just my imagination then. Knife Throw seems to be pretty worthless, it almost never hits, and Wraith herself seems extremely underpowered, or at least unimpressive, compared to her teammates. Which is not something I ever thought I'd say.</p>",
